@startuml delete_question_sequence
title Sequence Diagram - Teacher Delete Question Flow

actor Teacher
boundary "QuestionPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control QuestionController
control QuestionService
control QuestionRepository
entity "Question" as question
database DB

Teacher -> UI: Xóa câu hỏi
UI -> QuestionController: Xóa câu hỏi

QuestionController -> QuestionService: Xóa câu hỏi

QuestionService -> QuestionRepository: Kiểm tra tồn tại
QuestionRepository -> DB: SELECT question
DB --> QuestionRepository: question data
QuestionRepository -> question: Khởi tạo đối tượng (Map)
question --> QuestionRepository: Đối tượng Question

alt Không tồn tại
    QuestionRepository --> QuestionService: Error (not found)
    QuestionService --> QuestionController: Error
    QuestionController --> UI: 404 Not Found
else Tồn tại
    QuestionService -> QuestionRepository: Delete question
    QuestionRepository -> question: Khởi tạo/Gán dữ liệu

    QuestionRepository -> DB: DELETE question
    DB --> QuestionRepository: OK

    QuestionRepository --> QuestionService: Success
    QuestionService --> QuestionController: Success
    QuestionController --> UI: Xóa thành công
end

@enduml